OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADUP accused of 'anti-Irish        
OL,4,Abigotry' as education bill blocked     
OL,6,FA majority of 43 to 30 assembly members
OL,7,Fbacked the legislation on Tuesday, but 
OL,8,Fthe Democratic Unionist Party (DUP) had
OL,9,Ftabled a petition of concern - meaning 
OL,10,Fthe legislation required               
OL,11,Fcross-community support in order to    
OL,12,Fpass.                                  
OL,14,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill said   
OL,15,Fblocking the bill was "absolutely      
OL,16,Fdisgraceful" and accused unionist      
OL,17,Fparties of "anti-Irish bigotry".       
